{
  "title": "iOS: Add version history and comparison",
  "description": "The web app has full version history support: viewing all previous versions of a recipe with timestamps and source badges, side-by-side comparison of two versions, and reverting to any previous version. The iOS app has none of this. Add version history viewing, version comparison, and revert functionality to the iOS recipe detail view.",
